WEBVTT

00:00:03.430 --> 00:00:04.870
Shugo, shugo!

00:00:04.870 --> 00:00:07.520
Start it off with a Doki! It's Shugo Chara time!

00:00:07.520 --> 00:00:11.850
I have a feeling something 
really bad is going to happen today.

00:00:11.850 --> 00:00:14.310
The Prince and Amu-chan sure are happy together!

00:00:14.310 --> 00:00:16.860
They're completely lovey-dovey again.

00:00:16.860 --> 00:00:19.300
It's times like that when I'm especially worried!

00:00:19.300 --> 00:00:22.040
Ah, Miki, you're such a worrywart!

00:00:22.040 --> 00:00:24.480
So let's kick today off with an energetic...

00:00:24.480 --> 00:00:25.750
Doki!

00:00:49.510 --> 00:00:52.360
I'm gonna tell you a secret.

00:00:52.360 --> 00:00:55.270
Don't tell <i>anyone</i>, okay?

00:00:55.270 --> 00:00:58.160
Even though I'm not girly at all,

00:00:58.160 --> 00:01:00.930
two certain boys said they like me!

00:01:00.930 --> 00:01:03.870
Jump up a bit into the sky.

00:01:03.870 --> 00:01:06.750
My dearest friends are always there.

00:01:06.750 --> 00:01:09.580
Even if you suddenly Character Change,

00:01:09.580 --> 00:01:12.490
I'll be there to stop you with my great big heart.

00:01:12.490 --> 00:01:15.360
Pinky swear!

00:01:15.360 --> 00:01:17.760
Cross my heart!

00:01:18.240 --> 00:01:20.970
Lucky, happy, leave it to me!

00:01:20.970 --> 00:01:24.020
That'd be universal peace, but...

00:01:24.020 --> 00:01:26.770
I'll end up protectin' everyone's hearts.

00:01:26.770 --> 00:01:29.540
Let's all smile together!

00:01:29.540 --> 00:01:32.400
Lucky, happy, leave it to me!

00:01:32.400 --> 00:01:35.210
That's world peace! Yeah, that!

00:01:35.510 --> 00:01:38.440
Everyone has dreams, so I'm gonna protect 'em!

00:01:38.440 --> 00:01:41.260
Make a victory sign together!

00:01:57.760 --> 00:01:59.530
Flowers are amazing, don't you think?

00:02:00.690 --> 00:02:04.710
They're so tiny, but they use 
all their strength to bloom.

00:02:04.710 --> 00:02:08.610
And because of their efforts, 
they make people smile.

00:02:08.610 --> 00:02:11.520
I want to be like that.

00:02:12.340 --> 00:02:16.560
I don't want to keep secrets from him!

00:02:17.360 --> 00:02:18.590
Tadase-kun.

00:02:20.220 --> 00:02:23.100
Um, about Ikuto...

00:02:25.260 --> 00:02:26.290
Amu-chan.

00:02:28.080 --> 00:02:29.890
Let me tell you something.

00:02:30.500 --> 00:02:34.930
Tsukiyomi Ikuto is a black cat who 
brings nothing but misfortune.

00:02:36.180 --> 00:02:38.050
Misfortune?

00:02:38.050 --> 00:02:39.410
Black cat?

00:02:41.100 --> 00:02:46.100
Episode 77
Shocking! First Date, Busted!?

00:02:46.740 --> 00:02:50.350
I know that's what he said... but look at him.

00:02:50.950 --> 00:02:51.600
Yo.

00:02:51.870 --> 00:02:54.990
He's, like, totally relaxed.

00:02:54.990 --> 00:02:57.720
How exactly do you think that 
makes the person coming home feel, huh?

00:02:58.050 --> 00:02:58.890
Well, how?

00:02:58.890 --> 00:03:00.330
Shut up!

00:03:00.330 --> 00:03:01.220
Give me a break...

00:03:02.930 --> 00:03:05.470
A black cat that brings 
misfortune? I can't see it.

00:03:08.050 --> 00:03:10.900
Well, he is kind of like a house cat...

00:03:11.880 --> 00:03:15.220
Oh yeah, you hurt your 
shoulder, right? What happened?

00:03:15.480 --> 00:03:17.810
Dunno. Don't remember.

00:03:17.810 --> 00:03:20.720
"Dunno. Don't remember."

00:03:20.720 --> 00:03:23.950
Sure, whatever! Just let me see it!

00:03:26.900 --> 00:03:29.100
This doesn't look all that serious.

00:03:29.100 --> 00:03:31.970
But we'll still wash 
and disinfect it for now.

00:03:32.620 --> 00:03:35.040
Ah, I was hurt back here, too.

00:03:35.040 --> 00:03:36.560
Where? Where?

00:03:37.540 --> 00:03:38.640
Gotcha.

00:03:38.640 --> 00:03:40.270
Again?!

00:03:40.270 --> 00:03:42.720
Just when I was worrying about you, too!

00:03:43.010 --> 00:03:45.600
You're really gullible, you know that?

00:03:45.600 --> 00:03:47.810
That's just the way she is.

00:03:47.810 --> 00:03:50.620
But that's part of what 
makes Amu-chan so darling.

00:03:50.620 --> 00:03:52.090
Oh, shut up!

00:03:52.090 --> 00:03:53.850
Wait, where were you guys?

00:03:54.120 --> 00:03:56.320
You don't have to blow up at us like that.

00:03:56.320 --> 00:03:59.530
It's not easy keeping a secret, you know.

00:03:59.530 --> 00:04:00.870
Huh? Secret?

00:04:00.870 --> 00:04:03.810
I wonder if Yoru managed to get away...

00:04:07.360 --> 00:04:09.550
Wait up!

00:04:09.550 --> 00:04:10.660
Ami!

00:04:12.540 --> 00:04:14.200
Hmm, yes, I see...

00:04:13.030 --> 00:04:15.240
Aha, found you!

00:04:18.320 --> 00:04:20.890
Yoru, why are you dressed like that?

00:04:20.890 --> 00:04:23.640
I can't believe this!

00:04:23.640 --> 00:04:28.210
I kept running away 
from Kiseki, like you said.

00:04:28.210 --> 00:04:32.570
He finally gave up, so I figured 
it was safe to come back, but...

00:04:38.750 --> 00:04:41.500
She's been forcing me to 
play with her the whole time!

00:04:41.500 --> 00:04:42.770
Aw, don't worry about it.

00:04:42.770 --> 00:04:44.220
It looks lovely on you.

00:04:44.480 --> 00:04:46.830
I has clothes for eveybody!

00:04:47.470 --> 00:04:50.290
I-I'm not into that 
sort of thing, so...

00:04:50.290 --> 00:04:51.780
M-Me, neither!

00:04:51.780 --> 00:04:53.060
Wait up!

00:04:53.290 --> 00:04:56.030
Ami, wait, you've gotta quiet down. 
If Mom hears you-

00:04:56.030 --> 00:04:58.530
What a wonderful dress!

00:04:59.630 --> 00:05:02.450
Ami, don't go- 
I said don't go over there!

00:05:06.990 --> 00:05:08.820
Thanks for the food!

00:05:08.820 --> 00:05:09.890
Fanks!

00:05:09.890 --> 00:05:11.580
Thank you for this meal.

00:05:12.390 --> 00:05:15.530
What's got into you, Ami-chan? 
You're just beaming today.

00:05:15.530 --> 00:05:20.470
Oh, I heard you running around 
upstairs earlier. Were you playing a game?

00:05:20.470 --> 00:05:22.650
I was pwaying tag with da kitty!

00:05:22.650 --> 00:05:23.390
Ami!

00:05:24.380 --> 00:05:25.390
Kitty?

00:05:25.610 --> 00:05:27.480
Are you okay?

00:05:28.570 --> 00:05:32.220
Uh, right! We were 
pretending to be cats!

00:05:32.220 --> 00:05:34.140
Nya, nya...

00:05:35.560 --> 00:05:37.770
Amu, please have a seat over there.

00:05:38.560 --> 00:05:40.270
But I'm already sitting.

00:05:41.310 --> 00:05:44.370
Well, it's... You know, about before...

00:05:44.370 --> 00:05:46.730
Yeah, how is that young man doing?

00:05:46.730 --> 00:05:47.800
His name was Tadase-kun, right?

00:05:47.800 --> 00:05:48.860
Darling!

00:05:48.860 --> 00:05:51.140
Dat's Sis's boyfriend!

00:05:51.140 --> 00:05:52.130
Ami-chan!

00:05:52.130 --> 00:05:54.360
He was such a nice boy.

00:05:54.360 --> 00:05:55.480
And cute, too.

00:05:55.480 --> 00:05:56.690
Darling...

00:05:56.690 --> 00:05:58.810
Feel free to have him 
over whenever you like.

00:06:00.190 --> 00:06:02.390
I wanna see him, too!

00:06:02.830 --> 00:06:06.700
A-At least introduce him 
to us properly next time...

00:06:06.700 --> 00:06:07.810
Introduce?

00:06:07.810 --> 00:06:09.550
That's right, please do.

00:06:09.550 --> 00:06:10.750
Mom, you too?

00:06:10.750 --> 00:06:12.280
Meet da parents!

00:06:12.280 --> 00:06:13.600
But...

00:06:50.330 --> 00:06:52.040
What's the matter, Amu?

00:06:52.040 --> 00:06:54.030
You look totally beat.

00:06:54.030 --> 00:06:55.310
It's just...

00:06:55.310 --> 00:06:59.470
Amu-chan's dad is a real 
father-of-the-bride-type.

00:06:59.740 --> 00:07:02.100
Huh? Father is the bride?

00:07:02.100 --> 00:07:04.300
Amu-chan!

00:07:04.990 --> 00:07:06.470
That's not quite right-dechu.

00:07:07.760 --> 00:07:08.920
Good morning.

00:07:09.180 --> 00:07:11.390
Good morning, everyone.

00:07:11.390 --> 00:07:13.700
Hello, Tadase, Nagi!

00:07:13.700 --> 00:07:14.890
Good morning.

00:07:15.140 --> 00:07:16.680
Good morning, Amu-chan.

00:07:17.370 --> 00:07:18.700
Good morning.

00:07:20.080 --> 00:07:24.420
Tsukiyomi Ikuto is a black cat who 
brings nothing but misfortune.

00:07:25.920 --> 00:07:28.310
U-Um, Tadase-kun...

00:07:28.510 --> 00:07:29.470
What is it?

00:07:31.800 --> 00:07:34.110
It's nothing, never mind.

00:07:34.920 --> 00:07:37.420
Their passion burns bright and early!

00:07:37.420 --> 00:07:41.220
It's nice of you to get in the mood and all, 
but there's a time and place for everything.

00:07:41.220 --> 00:07:43.080
W-We're not in the mood!

00:07:43.080 --> 00:07:43.770
Yaya.

00:07:44.330 --> 00:07:47.390
All right, we'll just leave 
you two lovebirds alone.

00:07:47.610 --> 00:07:49.850
Have a nice time!

00:07:49.850 --> 00:07:50.780
Hey!

00:07:51.540 --> 00:07:55.430
Make sure you all set a good example 
in the interview after school.

00:07:55.680 --> 00:07:56.780
Interview?

00:07:58.730 --> 00:08:00.320
After school-dechu!

00:08:03.810 --> 00:08:07.660
These students are making 
a newspaper in their class.

00:08:07.660 --> 00:08:11.050
And they're here to interview 
all of us Guardians.

00:08:11.050 --> 00:08:12.970
Thanks for having us!

00:08:12.970 --> 00:08:14.320
Oh, that's what you meant.

00:08:14.320 --> 00:08:17.220
What do you want to ask? 
I've got all the answers!

00:08:17.450 --> 00:08:21.810
What kind of work do the Guardians do every day?

00:08:21.810 --> 00:08:23.240
We drink tea.

00:08:23.240 --> 00:08:24.570
And eat snacks.

00:08:24.570 --> 00:08:25.970
That's not all!

00:08:25.970 --> 00:08:27.800
Let me see...

00:08:27.800 --> 00:08:31.310
So that everyone can have 
a pleasant school life,

00:08:31.310 --> 00:08:35.020
we decide on a number of things, 
and discuss them with the teachers.

00:08:35.020 --> 00:08:36.320
For example...

00:08:36.850 --> 00:08:39.890
We took a survey about the school uniforms.

00:08:39.890 --> 00:08:41.170
Good job.

00:08:41.170 --> 00:08:42.650
And also...

00:08:43.480 --> 00:08:49.730
In the gym today, A court will be girl's 
volleyball and B court boy's basketball.

00:08:49.730 --> 00:08:51.510
Okay!

00:08:51.510 --> 00:08:54.310
We decide who gets to use the gym and the sports fields.

00:08:59.350 --> 00:09:02.490
And we're ringers for the sports teams, too! {What's a ringer?}

00:09:02.490 --> 00:09:05.760
Right, and we're also in charge
 of tending the flowers.

00:09:07.610 --> 00:09:09.350
Fujisaki-senpai...

00:09:09.890 --> 00:09:11.180
What is it?

00:09:11.380 --> 00:09:14.620
When will Nadeshiko-senpai 
be coming back?

00:09:15.350 --> 00:09:16.950
Um...

00:09:18.480 --> 00:09:21.180
Yaya-chan-senpai, will you 
let me do it, too?

00:09:21.440 --> 00:09:22.600
Sure, no prob.

00:09:22.600 --> 00:09:24.040
Me, too!

00:09:24.040 --> 00:09:26.700
But we only have one watering can, 
so let's take turns, okay?

00:09:26.700 --> 00:09:28.380
Okay, but I'll go first!

00:09:28.380 --> 00:09:30.640
No, I will!

00:09:30.640 --> 00:09:31.880
Me!

00:09:31.880 --> 00:09:33.370
Me!

00:09:32.690 --> 00:09:33.680
I said I'm going first!

00:09:33.680 --> 00:09:34.650
Me-

00:09:35.420 --> 00:09:40.380
Aw, man! I hate taking turns!

00:09:40.380 --> 00:09:42.680
Yaya-chan-senpai...

00:09:43.990 --> 00:09:46.140
Bala-balance!

00:09:47.580 --> 00:09:48.850
Your timing is off!

00:09:48.850 --> 00:09:50.050
You're too unsteady!

00:09:50.050 --> 00:09:51.770
And your pose isn't right
 in the first place!

00:09:51.770 --> 00:09:53.220
That's not even close!

00:09:53.220 --> 00:09:54.680
Don't take gags lightly!

00:09:56.690 --> 00:09:58.680
M-Mashiro-senpai?

00:10:00.450 --> 00:10:02.850
Here. You water the flowers, too.

00:10:15.720 --> 00:10:17.770
Back in lovey-dovey mode?

00:10:17.770 --> 00:10:19.320
They're lovey-dovey?

00:10:19.320 --> 00:10:20.560
Quite.

00:10:21.420 --> 00:10:22.990
Hey, that's enough-

00:10:22.990 --> 00:10:24.710
What attracted you to him?

00:10:24.710 --> 00:10:27.020
Which one of you confessed?

00:10:27.020 --> 00:10:29.100
Are you dating?

00:10:29.930 --> 00:10:32.140
Not you guys, too!

00:10:34.060 --> 00:10:35.540
Everyone likes...

00:10:35.540 --> 00:10:37.030
...a good love story, you know?

00:10:37.030 --> 00:10:38.780
That's right!

00:10:55.350 --> 00:10:59.750
Yaya and Rima were acting weird. 
What's with them?

00:11:01.850 --> 00:11:04.570
Now, now, time to get going!

00:11:04.570 --> 00:11:06.060
Wait, Yaya...

00:11:06.060 --> 00:11:09.240
Here. We'll take care of the rest.

00:11:09.240 --> 00:11:10.660
Rima?

00:11:11.260 --> 00:11:13.580
Good luck, Hotori-kun.

00:11:13.580 --> 00:11:15.210
Fujisaki-kun...

00:11:23.270 --> 00:11:24.510
Tadase-kun?

00:11:24.510 --> 00:11:29.020
Um, they're having a flower arrangement exhibition at the gallery in front of the train station.

00:11:29.270 --> 00:11:31.550
But it ends today...

00:11:31.550 --> 00:11:32.430
Yeah?

00:11:32.650 --> 00:11:37.220
So I was thinking, maybe you and I 
could go check it out together?

00:11:37.220 --> 00:11:38.040
Huh?

00:11:38.670 --> 00:11:40.770
You mean like...

00:11:40.990 --> 00:11:44.730
One of those date things?! {This is a literal translation. This is lol and perfect.}

00:11:44.730 --> 00:11:46.670
Amu-chan snapped.

00:11:46.670 --> 00:11:48.720
Will she be okay?

00:11:48.720 --> 00:11:50.560
I-I'd be happy to.

00:11:52.120 --> 00:11:54.680
How about we meet at four o'clock 
in front of the fountain?

00:11:55.620 --> 00:11:56.740
Sure!

00:11:57.640 --> 00:11:59.520
I'm home!

00:12:00.810 --> 00:12:02.640
What should I wear?

00:12:02.640 --> 00:12:06.310
My black skirt? Though my checkered one 
might be good, too...

00:12:08.970 --> 00:12:11.310
I totally forgot about him.

00:12:12.310 --> 00:12:13.770
What put you on cloud nine?

00:12:14.020 --> 00:12:15.650
N-Nothing at all!

00:12:15.650 --> 00:12:17.270
I'm not.

00:12:17.850 --> 00:12:20.120
Something happened 
between you and Tadase, huh?

00:12:20.120 --> 00:12:23.150
I-I don't know what you're talking about!

00:12:23.150 --> 00:12:25.360
Like going on a date with him, for example.

00:12:25.360 --> 00:12:27.810
In that case, you'd better take a ba-

00:12:27.810 --> 00:12:30.810
Shut up! If we're talking about baths here, 
 you're the one who needs one!

00:12:30.810 --> 00:12:33.380
Clean up that cut!

00:12:33.380 --> 00:12:35.310
Where are they going-nya?

00:12:35.540 --> 00:12:37.060
Here's a towel and a change of clothes.

00:12:37.060 --> 00:12:40.560
And this is a shirt my dad doesn't 
wear anymore. I'll leave them here.

00:12:40.840 --> 00:12:42.900
Dad went to pick up Ami-chan.

00:12:42.900 --> 00:12:44.390
And Mom's out shopping.

00:12:44.390 --> 00:12:46.930
So they're both gone.

00:12:47.160 --> 00:12:48.450
Kind of cramped, though.

00:12:48.450 --> 00:12:50.390
What're you talking 
about? It's a normal size.

00:12:50.620 --> 00:12:53.600
Yeah, but it'll be cramped for two people.

00:12:53.600 --> 00:12:55.310
You stupid cat!

00:12:55.310 --> 00:12:57.180
I hope you drown! {lit: "Go and boil yourself!" but I think this is funnier in english. AHAHAHAHA yes}

00:12:57.530 --> 00:12:59.610
I'm still wearing my clothes.

00:12:59.610 --> 00:13:01.180
Like I care! Get undressed right there!

00:13:01.450 --> 00:13:02.910
Sheesh...

00:13:07.850 --> 00:13:09.190
No peeping.

00:13:09.190 --> 00:13:10.310
As if I would!

00:13:11.290 --> 00:13:13.610
What's his problem?

00:13:14.600 --> 00:13:15.790
Amu-chan?

00:13:15.790 --> 00:13:16.720
Mom?

00:13:16.720 --> 00:13:18.310
You're taking a bath at this time of day?

00:13:18.610 --> 00:13:21.070
I'd like to put away the detergent I bought.

00:13:21.070 --> 00:13:23.890
You can't! I'm naked right now! Do it later!

00:13:39.680 --> 00:13:42.220
Shoot, it's already this late?

00:13:42.220 --> 00:13:43.900
The meeting time...

00:13:43.900 --> 00:13:48.250
Clothes... Hey, could you 
bring me my clothes?

00:13:49.180 --> 00:13:50.500
Please!

00:13:51.440 --> 00:13:52.890
Are these okay?

00:13:54.370 --> 00:13:57.390
That's not really what I 
had in mind for today.

00:13:57.590 --> 00:13:59.460
Then get them yourself!

00:13:59.460 --> 00:14:01.300
You mustn't be so demanding!

00:14:01.300 --> 00:14:03.600
You didn't have enough time, right?

00:14:06.390 --> 00:14:07.780
So Ikuto...

00:14:08.560 --> 00:14:10.890
Would you wait a bit before coming out?

00:14:10.890 --> 00:14:12.710
I'm going to change, too.

00:14:12.710 --> 00:14:13.770
Fine.

00:14:13.770 --> 00:14:18.210
I-I'm not joking. Don't you dare go 
jumping out of there, got it?

00:14:18.210 --> 00:14:22.000
I'm not going to do 
something you'd actually hate.

00:14:22.000 --> 00:14:24.470
I'm facing the wall, so hurry up.

00:14:24.470 --> 00:14:25.510
Okay.

00:14:28.480 --> 00:14:30.350
He's really facing the wall...

00:14:32.270 --> 00:14:36.100
Once in a while, Ikuto does act responsible.

00:14:36.350 --> 00:14:40.650
He's constantly giving me a hard time...

00:14:40.650 --> 00:14:43.820
But when I'm in real trouble, 
he always comes to my rescue.

00:14:44.330 --> 00:14:47.270
And he understands how I feel.

00:14:47.990 --> 00:14:52.970
I have to tell Tadase that Ikuto isn't 
the bad person he thinks he is.

00:14:52.970 --> 00:14:56.100
I'm sure he'll understand.

00:15:07.640 --> 00:15:12.000
Leaving them alone together is merely an 
example of my benevolence as King.

00:15:12.000 --> 00:15:14.080
Good luck to you, Tadase!

00:15:16.130 --> 00:15:18.390
Okay? Ready to go?

00:15:18.680 --> 00:15:19.700
Yeah.

00:15:26.930 --> 00:15:28.200
Mom?

00:15:29.090 --> 00:15:31.250
And just <i>what</i> is going on here?

00:15:42.990 --> 00:15:46.310
And I thought you'd picked up a cat 
or something off the street.

00:15:49.800 --> 00:15:52.810
Who knows what might've happened 
if your father had discovered you...

00:15:54.140 --> 00:15:56.980
Amu-chan!

00:15:56.980 --> 00:15:58.480
I'm sorry.

00:15:58.480 --> 00:16:02.860
I'm the one at fault. I had nowhere to go and ended up staying here.

00:16:03.270 --> 00:16:05.130
I'll leave right away.

00:16:05.750 --> 00:16:07.220
No!

00:16:07.470 --> 00:16:11.050
Ikuto's not feeling well! 
And he's here for a reason...

00:16:19.000 --> 00:16:20.730
I know.

00:16:21.620 --> 00:16:24.620
I know that you and Ikuto-kun aren't bad kids.

00:16:24.620 --> 00:16:25.890
I know that.

00:16:26.460 --> 00:16:29.570
And I know you have your reasons for this.

00:16:30.550 --> 00:16:35.490
I'm not angry that you let 
Ikuto-kun stay here on your own.

00:16:35.490 --> 00:16:38.220
Well, maybe a little.

00:16:38.520 --> 00:16:39.890
Then...

00:16:40.200 --> 00:16:41.470
I just wish...

00:16:42.720 --> 00:16:44.970
that you hadn't kept it a secret from us.

00:16:45.980 --> 00:16:49.240
I wish you would've trusted your parents.

00:16:52.600 --> 00:16:54.470
I'm sorry...

00:16:57.310 --> 00:17:03.750
Now, no matter what reasons you may have, 
I can't allow you to stay here any longer.

00:17:03.750 --> 00:17:05.610
I'm sure you can understand.

00:17:05.610 --> 00:17:07.030
Yes.

00:17:07.030 --> 00:17:08.650
Thank you for everything.

00:17:08.650 --> 00:17:10.020
Ikuto...

00:17:10.020 --> 00:17:12.890
For the time being, let's find you a business hotel. {why would he need a business hotel? >_>;; weird Japanese}

00:17:14.220 --> 00:17:16.730
You can stay there tonight.

00:17:16.730 --> 00:17:20.610
And if you aren't feeling well, 
you should go to a hospital.

00:17:20.610 --> 00:17:23.430
From now on, we'll work together to figure 
out what you should do, all right?

00:17:25.500 --> 00:17:28.310
That'll be for the best, Amu.

00:17:29.990 --> 00:17:31.470
Mom...

00:17:35.270 --> 00:17:36.560
Take care of yourself!

00:17:36.560 --> 00:17:38.600
Don't get down on yourself! Keep trying!

00:17:38.600 --> 00:17:40.690
Please eat this.

00:17:40.690 --> 00:17:43.310
Guys... I'm sorry-nya.

00:17:44.640 --> 00:17:45.890
And this?

00:17:46.570 --> 00:17:49.870
You don't have to give it back. 
My dad doesn't wear it anymore.

00:17:49.870 --> 00:17:51.160
I see.

00:17:53.140 --> 00:17:55.830
Ikuto's leaving?

00:17:55.830 --> 00:17:59.470
Having him here made 
me so nervous, but...

00:18:00.300 --> 00:18:01.990
Will I miss him?

00:18:01.990 --> 00:18:06.010
This shirt smells like it was just washed.

00:18:06.570 --> 00:18:11.550
Your mom even cleans old shirts 
your dad doesn't wear anymore, huh?

00:18:12.050 --> 00:18:13.680
That's kind of nice.

00:18:14.040 --> 00:18:17.690
Yeah, I guess so. I never 
really thought about it.

00:18:17.690 --> 00:18:19.990
That's because it's normal for you.

00:18:20.740 --> 00:18:23.420
You might not've noticed or even thought about it,

00:18:23.420 --> 00:18:26.160
but your parents have always been watching over you.

00:18:26.690 --> 00:18:29.140
That sure sounds nice...

00:18:29.140 --> 00:18:30.720
Ikuto...

00:18:31.360 --> 00:18:35.370
Amu-chan, you have a guest! It's that boy!

00:18:37.020 --> 00:18:38.030
Tadase-kun?!

00:18:38.030 --> 00:18:38.970
Come on in.

00:18:38.970 --> 00:18:40.040
Pardon the intrusion.

00:18:41.290 --> 00:18:44.020
Stay right there! Don't come out, got it?!

00:18:46.790 --> 00:18:47.770
Tadase-kun...

00:18:48.010 --> 00:18:52.680
Amu-chan! Thank goodness. I was worried you'd 
gotten into an accident or something.

00:18:52.680 --> 00:18:56.360
Sorry! I was just about to head out...

00:18:56.970 --> 00:18:58.630
Okay then, let's go.

00:19:07.210 --> 00:19:09.340
Tsukiyomi Ikuto?

00:19:10.600 --> 00:19:13.310
Why... are you here?

00:19:13.310 --> 00:19:16.560
I was shacking up in her room.

00:19:16.560 --> 00:19:18.260
Hey, Ikuto!

00:19:19.620 --> 00:19:22.580
What's the meaning of this, Amu-chan?

00:19:22.580 --> 00:19:24.810
Tadase-kun, I can explain...

00:19:25.550 --> 00:19:27.000
How long?

00:19:27.000 --> 00:19:28.020
This whole time.

00:19:29.060 --> 00:19:31.890
I was hiding here during your last visit.

00:19:32.170 --> 00:19:35.220
"Will you let me fall in love with you," was it?

00:19:36.540 --> 00:19:39.830
Quite a passionate confession for a little boy.

00:19:40.740 --> 00:19:43.050
Ikuto, why are you telling him-

00:19:42.230 --> 00:19:43.780
Amu-chan...

00:19:44.930 --> 00:19:47.850
Amu-chan, you knew?

00:19:52.040 --> 00:19:53.130
I see.

00:19:55.090 --> 00:19:56.170
Wait!

00:20:14.220 --> 00:20:15.280
You idiot!

00:20:15.280 --> 00:20:16.440
Why would you do that?!

00:20:16.440 --> 00:20:17.490
You're so mean!

00:20:17.490 --> 00:20:19.470
Why would you say 
something like that?!

00:20:19.470 --> 00:20:22.220
I don't ever want to see you again!

00:20:22.220 --> 00:20:24.440
You...

00:20:24.440 --> 00:20:26.610
Just get the hell out of here!

00:20:36.070 --> 00:20:37.270
Let's go.

00:20:54.660 --> 00:20:57.260
Ikuto, I get what you just did.

00:20:57.260 --> 00:21:01.180
You made her mad on purpose so you 
wouldn't get her family involved.

00:21:01.180 --> 00:21:02.390
Shut up.

00:21:02.390 --> 00:21:06.570
It's better if no one gets 
near the black cat of misfortune.

00:21:12.060 --> 00:21:15.740
You have nowhere left to run, Tsukiyomi Ikuto.

00:21:18.270 --> 00:21:21.370
All righty, then! Time to go home!

00:21:21.370 --> 00:21:22.850
Senpai!

00:21:23.500 --> 00:21:25.220
We finished the newspaper!

00:21:25.220 --> 00:21:26.310
Take a look!

00:21:29.320 --> 00:21:31.310
"Best couple," huh?

00:22:06.630 --> 00:22:08.570
I hurt him.

00:22:08.570 --> 00:22:13.350
Never in my life have I... 
hurt someone... that deeply...

00:22:14.260 --> 00:22:17.420
What have I done?

00:22:31.690 --> 00:22:36.260
Maybe I was wrong to pretend not to notice your worries.

00:22:36.260 --> 00:22:41.070
It's okay if you can't tell me everything.

00:22:41.070 --> 00:22:45.690
With that dark look on your face, go ahead and scream dark things.

00:22:45.690 --> 00:22:50.000
You shouldn't leave all those heavy feelings inside.

00:22:50.000 --> 00:22:51.480
Ride On!

00:22:54.870 --> 00:22:57.680
If you don't... If it's like that...

00:22:57.680 --> 00:23:00.600
You couldn't tell me if you wanted to, huh?

00:23:01.860 --> 00:23:04.350
I get it.

00:23:04.350 --> 00:23:07.010
I'm sure your circumstances will change one day.

00:23:07.010 --> 00:23:10.040
That time will come! That time is now!

00:23:13.860 --> 00:23:15.670
Don't you want to have someone

00:23:15.670 --> 00:23:18.300
say congratulations to you once in your life?

00:23:18.300 --> 00:23:23.230
Doesn't the breeze feel nice today?

00:23:23.230 --> 00:23:27.600
Even if you feel like it's all you can do to survive...

00:23:27.600 --> 00:23:32.470
You can make your life into something you enjoy. It's so nice!

00:23:32.470 --> 00:23:37.290
"Everything's for you."

00:23:37.290 --> 00:23:41.890
How about that?

00:23:43.590 --> 00:23:45.040
My boy!

00:23:50.930 --> 00:23:52.350
What am I going to do?

00:23:52.350 --> 00:23:55.520
Amu-chan, cheer up. It's time for the preview.

00:23:55.520 --> 00:23:58.640
Preview? No way, I'm not in the mood.

00:23:58.640 --> 00:24:01.430
Now we can't have that! 
You're the heroine, after all!

00:24:01.430 --> 00:24:04.540
But... you know what happened!

00:24:04.540 --> 00:24:05.440
What am I going to do?

00:24:05.440 --> 00:24:09.990
Well then, I suppose I'll do it today instead!

00:24:09.990 --> 00:24:12.500
Next time on Shugo Chara!! Doki:

00:24:12.500 --> 00:24:14.470
Amu-chan's Loong Day!? {note: Loong is [sic] Ugh. Pain. :p }

00:24:14.470 --> 00:24:16.770
Hey! Didn't I say I'd do it?

00:24:16.770 --> 00:24:18.150
This is all your fault, Amu-chan!

00:24:18.150 --> 00:24:19.520
Huh, why?
